      "slide_number": 4,
      "slide_type": "content_single",
      "content": {
        "title": "What is Data Science?",
        "text": "Data Science is an interdisciplinary field that uses scientific methods, processes, algorithms, and systems to extract knowledge and insights from structured and unstructured data.\n\nIt combines multiple fields including:\n• Statistics and Mathematics\n• Computer Science and Programming\n• Domain Expertise\n• Data Visualization\n• Machine Learning and AI\n\nData scientists solve complex problems by analyzing large amounts of data to identify patterns, make predictions, and drive decision-making."
      },
      "speaker_notes": "Data science sits at the intersection of multiple disciplines.",
      "transition": "slide",
      "duration": 35
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 5,
      "slide_type": "text_image_right",
      "content": {
        "title": "The Data Science Process",
        "text": "The typical data science workflow:\n\n1. Problem Definition\n   - Understanding business needs\n   - Defining success metrics\n\n2. Data Collection\n   - Identifying data sources\n   - Gathering relevant data\n\n3. Data Cleaning\n   - Handling missing values\n   - Removing outliers\n\n4. Exploratory Analysis\n   - Statistical summaries\n   - Pattern identification",
        "image": "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=301"
      },
      "speaker_notes": "This process is iterative - you'll often go back to earlier steps.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 40
    },
    {
      "slide_number": 6,
      "slide_type": "process_flow",
      "content": {
