        "title": "Statistical Foundations",
        "text": "Key statistical concepts:\n\n• Descriptive Statistics\n  - Mean, Median, Mode\n  - Standard Deviation\n  - Percentiles\n\n• Probability Distributions\n  - Normal Distribution\n  - Binomial Distribution\n  - Poisson Distribution\n\n• Hypothesis Testing\n  - p-values\n  - Confidence Intervals\n  - Type I & II Errors",
        "image": "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=302"
      },
      "speaker_notes": "Statistics forms the mathematical foundation of data science.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 35
